{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["为泰尔唱哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人子啊，你要为泰尔唱哀歌，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["告诉位于海口、跟沿海各民族通商的泰尔，主耶和华这样说，",{"text":"“‘泰尔啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾夸耀自己完美无瑕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的疆域在大海上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的建造者把你造得完美无瑕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们用示尼珥的松木做你的船板，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用黎巴嫩的香柏木做桅杆，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用巴珊的橡木做你的桨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把象牙镶嵌在基提沿岸的黄杨木上做甲板，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用埃及来的绣花细麻布做你的帆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作为你的旗号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用以利沙岛来的蓝布和紫布做船篷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西顿和亚发的居民是你的船夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的智者在船上为你掌舵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦巴勒的老手和巧匠在船上为你修补船篷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有海船和水手都来与你做生意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“‘你军队中的战士有波斯人、路德人、弗人，他们在你的墙上挂起盾牌和头盔，展示你的光彩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["亚发人和你的军队都守卫在你的城墙上，歌玛底人把守你的城楼，他们在你四围的墙上挂满盾牌，使你完美无瑕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["“‘他施人因你有丰富的货物，就拿银、铁、锡、铅来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["雅完人、土巴人、米设人也跟你通商，用奴隶和铜器来换取你的货物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["陀迦玛人用马匹、战马和骡子来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["底但人也是你的客商，你的市场远及沿海一带，他们拿象牙、乌木来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因为你的货物丰富，亚兰人也成了你的客户，他们用绿宝石、紫布、刺绣、细麻布、珊瑚和红宝石与你交换货物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["犹大和以色列也是你的客商，他们用米匿的麦、饼、蜜、油和香料与你交换货物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["大马士革见你的货物丰富，就用黑本的酒和沙哈的羊毛来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["从乌萨来的威但人和雅完人用熟铁、肉桂、菖蒲与你交换货物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["底但人用马鞍垫来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["阿拉伯人和基达的所有首领都来做你的客商，他们用羊羔、绵羊和山羊来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["示巴和拉玛的商人用各类上等香料、宝石和黄金交换你的货物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["哈兰、干尼、伊甸、示巴、亚述和基抹的商人都来跟你交易，"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他们把华丽衣服、蓝布、刺绣和彩色地毯捆扎结实，拿来跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"“‘他施的船只替你运货，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在海上载满沉甸甸的货物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"船夫把你摇到汪洋之中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但东风要把你击碎在海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的财富、货物、商品、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水手、舵手、修补匠、客商、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战士和人民在你倾覆的日子都要沉到深海里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你舵手的哀号声必震动海岸，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的船夫、水手、舵手都必弃船登岸，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为你放声痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把尘埃撒在头上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在灰中打滚，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又为你剃光头发，腰束麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并为你伤心哭泣，痛苦哀号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在痛哭中为你唱起哀歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀悼你说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有哪一座城像泰尔一样在深海中销声匿迹呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的货物由海上运出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"满足了许多国家；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的资财和货物使地上的君王富裕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今你在汪洋中被海浪击碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的货物和人民都一同沉没了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沿海的居民因你而惊骇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王都吓得面容失色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各国商人都嗤笑你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你那可怕的末日来临了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你将永远不复存在。’”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":36}